{
  "id": "ZEC.1",
  "number": "1",
  "bookId": "ZEC",
  "reference": "Zekaria 1",
  "copyright": "Biblica® Ochiw Thuolo Motingʼo Loko Manyien™ Weg Loko © 1980, 2002, 2003, 2020 otim gi Biblica, Inc. Biblica® Open New Luo Translation™ Copyright © 1980, 2002, 2003, 2020 by Biblica, Inc. \"Biblica\" en sai mondik mongorore e piny Amerika kendo en kido moyie malongʼo e ofis Biblica, Inc. Itiyo kode gi thuolo moa kuom Biblica, Inc. \"Biblica\" is a trademark registered in the United States Patent and Trademark Office by Biblica, Inc. Used with permission.",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ZEC 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Oluong jo-Israel mondo oduogi ir Jehova Nyasaye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E dwe mar aboro, e higa mar ariyo mar loch Darius, wach Jehova Nyasaye nobiro ni janabi Zekaria wuod Berekia, ma wuod Ido, kawacho niya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Jehova Nyasaye nosin ahinya gi kwereu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuom mano wachnegi ni: Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye Maratego wacho: 'Dwoguru ira,' Jehova Nyasaye Maratego wacho. 'Eka an bende anaduog iru,' Jehova Nyasaye Maratego ema owacho kamano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kik uchal gi kwereu, mane jonabi machon oywak nigi kawacho ni: Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye Maratego wacho, 'Lokreuru uwe yoreu maricho kod timbeu maricho.' To negitamore winja kata dewa, Jehova Nyasaye owacho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bende kwereugo gi jonabi pod ngima nyaka sani?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To donge wechena gi yorena mane achiko jotichna ma jonabi nojuko kwereu?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "ZEC 1:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Omiyo negilokore kendo giwacho ni, 'Jehova Nyasaye Maratego osetimonwa gima owinjore gi yorewa kod timbewa, mana kaka nochano timo.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ngʼat mochungʼ e dier yiend kuth ochwoga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tarik piero ariyo gangʼwen mar dwe mar apar gachiel, miluongo ni Shebat, e higa mar ariyo mar loch Darius, wach Jehova Nyasaye nobiro ni janabi Zekaria wuod Berekia, ma wuod Ido.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naneno fweny gotieno ka ngʼat moro moidho faras ma silwal opore e nyima. Ne ochungʼ e dier yiend kuth ochwoga, e holo moro. Yo ka diengʼeye ne nitie farese masilwende, marobuore kod marochere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Napenjo niya, \"Magi gin angʼo, yaye ruodha?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "ZEC 1:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Malaika mane wuoyo koda nodwoka niya, \"Abiro nyisi gima gin.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eka ngʼat mane ochungʼ e dier yiend kuth ochwoga nonyisa niya, \"Gin e joma Jehova Nyasaye oseoro mondo odhi e piny koni gi koni.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To negidwoko wach ne malaika mar Jehova Nyasaye, mane ochungʼ e dier yiend kuth ochwoga, kagiwacho niya, \"Wasewuotho e piny koni gi koni mi wayudo ka piny ngima yweyo kendo nigi kwe.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eka malaika mar Jehova Nyasaye nowacho niya, \"Jehova Nyasaye Maratego, nyaka karangʼo mibiro lingʼ mak ikecho Jerusalem gi mier mag Juda misebedo kikechogo kuom higni piero abiriyogi?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eka Jehova Nyasaye nowuoyo gi malaika mane loso koda gi weche mangʼwon kod weche mag hoch.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eka malaika mane wuoyo koda nowachona niya, \"Ywagri kiwacho ne ji kama: Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye Maratego wacho, 'Nyiego omaka matek nikech Jerusalem gi Sayun,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to bende akecho ahinya gi ogendini modak kodhialore. Mokwongo ne akecho mana matin, to koro gisemiyo chandruok omedo doko malit moloyo.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Kuom mano, Jehova Nyasaye wacho ni, 'Abiro duogo Jerusalem mi akeche, mi oda nochak oger kanyo; kendo tol mipimogo ibiro rie e alwora mar Jerusalem,' Jehova Nyasaye Maratego ema owacho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Med lendo kiwacho kama: Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye Maratego wacho: 'Miecha duto biro pongʼ gi mwandu, kendo Jehova Nyasaye biro hoyo Sayun kendo obiro chako oyiero Jerusalem!' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tunge angʼwen kod jotheth angʼwen",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eka natingʼo wangʼa, mi napo kaneno tunge angʼwen!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Napenjo malaika mane wuoyo koda niya, \"Magi gin angʼo?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "ZEC 1:19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nodwoka niya, \"Magi e tunge mane okeyo Juda, Israel kod Jerusalem.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eka Jehova Nyasaye nonyisa jotheth angʼwen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Napenjo niya, \"Jogi obiro timo angʼo ka?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "ZEC 1:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nodwoko niya, \"Magi e tunge mane okeyo jo-Juda mondo kik ngʼato angʼata kuomgi tingʼ wiye; to jothethgi osebiro mondo obwog-gi kendo gilo ogendini mane oikore kedo gi piny Juda.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "ZEC.2",
    "number": "2",
